&_nc_oc=AdqT41qvLvhrFbNvoba2C0PSA9Uxy01YygWWXgYeguNB4DGj4DngkLNzMNyzYfao0tE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy0voEZcv-oyu6KeK01U-jURcWohzXdaqmPRC4eL6gXLg&oe=69CBACFE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ObF_QbO4bRQQ7kNvwFQI8jZ&_nc_oc=AdojzTd8Ar9hcFSiv3wLmeOMXTFCr0wVbXyFjTdMJ4vjo-MgAyD4btHT6St3R2tEGSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxNES0kQx252okka864lYtGQ9DJ8rd3hgfU-iQAO4DPuA&oe=69CBBDFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p55I9hUVZb8Q7kNvwF7yHj0&_nc_oc=AdqnKS2sGhxGc80QJ69IZi2orrLVp0OkzKEE-cVnq1whTuc1Eqaxl4w_ZO1eTAM3xpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyN4aC1SsFH6jO6kkfeZC1i8P_Gb671slh5pJNoUC9NqQ&oe=69CBDC87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQ5lUTm6FdoQ7kNvwHbh4Fv&_nc_oc=AdpXPsTiksIHSVheJcdZI12C4J_nY_uE0DcaO0QYqkzOTqhcROSC1a_7wnBisgYbm-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwCf00Ox1ZnKPXIAaRi769t_Tczq9mo8C7zHRy0ACDLZw&oe=69CBC855"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oLaomIUhtAUQ7kNvwG06Xq0&_nc_oc=AdokC59hP5-HftQMyv6MQ1m_8HDt0_Hn-eelFSJokVEHmdUZ49dEUwHT69qZ3hps_eg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy8j_WHBgUPvheeLD4OFjWYhllzWqy5EgX8sGPuex0QLg&oe=69CBD4E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.